        {
          "text": "Nuko ni mukūreh’ umwambiro wa kera, kugira ngo mube irobe risha, nk’uko mutarimw’ umwambiro. Kuk’ umwagazi w’intama wa Pasika wacu watanzwe kw ikimazi, ari we Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
