        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko sinavuga abasambanyi bo mu b’iyi si, cank’ abifuza, cank’ abanyazi, cank’ abasenga ibigirwamana, kukw iyo biba birtyo mwari mukwiye kuva mw isi. ",
